<section identifier="/us/usc/t99/s1"><num value="1">§ 1.</num><heading>Fees</heading>
<subsection identifier="/us/usc/t99/s1/a"><num value="a">(a)</num><content>A fee of one coin is due.</content><proviso><i>Provided</i>, That no fee is due on a holiday.</proviso></subsection>
